# Manual requests for Visual Studio (open this file and click "Send request").
# Start the app with the "https" profile first.

@host = https://localhost:7227

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Delivery update from the WhatsApp/SMS provider (week 7).
# In Development with an empty Messaging:WebhookSecret the signature is not checked.
# Copy a provider message id ("fake-…") from the log or the Seq/console output of FakeMessageSender.
POST {{host}}/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messageId": "fake-paste-the-id-here", "status": "read" }

### Several updates at once
POST {{host}}/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "messageId": "fake-paste-the-id-here", "status": "delivered" },
  { "messageId": "fake-another-id", "status": "failed", "error": "Number is not on WhatsApp" }
]
